---
description: Atlas OS engineering quality bar
alwaysApply: true
---

TypeScript strict. Avoid `any`. No unused-disable noise.

Preserve buildability. After a milestone, run lint, typecheck, and build.

Test domain logic: authz isolation, memory extract/update, retrieval ranking, model routing, and capability permissions.

Do not leave secrets in client bundles or commit `.env.local`.

Do not add dependencies for features that are not being implemented in the current task.

Fix errors. Do not accumulate warnings as a backlog.

If implementation diverges from `docs/`, update the docs in the same change.
